l seed count; minimum 5, recommended 10.\\n\\nEnd of design. Awaiting reviewer feedback on metric definitions, controls, or the placeholders before any execution attempt.\",\"evidence\":\"(1) Workspace inspection: `ls -laR /workspace` returns a single 0600 file `task.json` (466 B); no other files exist, including no `track.md`. The only reference to `track.md` is the string \\\"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\\\" inside `task.json.documents`. (2) Local availability of TorchOpt / TorchViz / torch: `find` up to depth 7 returned zero directory matches for torchopt/torchviz/torch; Python 3.12.3 and pip 24.0 are present but `import torch`, `import torchviz`, `import torchopt` all fail with `ModuleNotFoundError`; no install attempted (no-network rule). (3) Researcher authorizations captured verbatim in Section 10(a)-(d) per explicit instruction to restate so a reader can audit. (4) No TorchOpt / TorchViz internals fabricated beyond the entry points needed to specify the API surface; any detail that cannot be stated confidently is marked with protocol placeholders [P-1]-[P-8]. (5) No execution claimed; the design specifies procedures at a level a future executor could implement mechanically.\",\"assumptions\":[{\"item\":{\"item\":{\"item\":{\"item\":{\"item\":{\"item\":\"D.6 This deliverable is design-only; no execution is claimed. Protocol placeholders [P-1] through [P-8] are flagged for executor-time confirmation.</item>\",\"$text\":\"D.5 CPU-only scope; results not generalized to GPU-fused backends.</item>\"},\"$text\":\"D.4 At least 5 paired seeds (10 recommended); statistical claims limited to the sign test and matched-pairs rank-biserial.</item>\"},\"$text\":\"D.3 make_dot op labels are sufficiently stable across conditions for the per-block bucketing; ambiguity handled by [P-7].</item>\"},\"$text\":\"D.2 weight_decay=0.0 is locked across all conditions to control B5 reporting.</item>\"},\"$text\":\"D.1 Four conditions (C0=torch.optim.Ada